OL,3,GNEWSANHS wait woman 'would have died if
OL,4,Awe did not act'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of delays across the NHS
OL,7,Fnearly cost a woman her life after her
OL,8,Fcolon burst and she developed
OL,9,Fsepticaemia, her husband says.
OL,11,FAndrew Jones and his wife Diane phoned
OL,12,F999 three times before driving to
OL,13,FDerriford Hospital in Plymouth, Devon -
OL,14,F24 miles (39km) from their home near
OL,15,FLaunceston in Cornwall. However, they
OL,16,Fhad to wait for hours as her condition
OL,17,Fworsened and she underwent emergency
OL,18,Fsurgery.
OL,20,F"She would have died if we hadn't acted
OL,21,F` there's no doubt about it," Jones
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
